{"term":"diversity","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:4ac13021f2cf2d3c93","definition":"The quality of being diverse or different; a difference or unlikeness.","example":"From this view of the case, my friends, I am driven irresistibly to the conclusion that diversity, dissimilarity, variety in all our local and domestic institutions, is the great safeguard of our liberties","pos":"noun","synonyms":["disuniformity","diversity","heterogeneity","irregularity","multiformity","nonconformity","nonhomogeneity","nonregularity","nonuniformity","unconformity","variety"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["agrodiversity","antidiversity","bibliodiversity","biodiversity","chemodiversity","cyberdiversity","dieversity","divershitty","diversicrat","diversity fatigue","diversity hire","diversity is perversity","diversity jurisdiction","diversity statement","ecodiversity","ethnodiversity","evaluative diversity","genetic diversity","genodiversity","geodiversity","hyperdiversity","ichnodiversity","ichthyodiversity","linguistic diversity index","macrodiversity","megadiversity","microdiversity","moral diversity","multidiversity","mycodiversity"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/diversity#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:1995d32c4a4e0f78da","definition":"A variety; diverse types or examples.","example":"Hendryx has laid down eight tracks that flow seamlessly through funk, disco, gospel, rock and reggae, with nary a false step along the way. She is at home in this diversity of styles because she has paid her dues in all of them: from her days as one of the dynamoes of Labelle through collaborations with rock band Talking Heads, funk band Cameo […]","pos":"noun","synonyms":["selection"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["agrodiversity","antidiversity","bibliodiversit